2. Detalhes de volume — background has a gradient; "editar exercicio" and "novo exercicio" (buttons/modals?) should have the same gradient. Need to find those in the app: probably in the workout feature (Ficha) — "Editar exercício", "Novo exercício" modals/cards. Find the volume detail background gradient and apply similar to those.

3. Guildas: "os comentários rápidos e deixe os textos das mensagens com visibilidade melhor (maiores)" — probably: the quick replies (comentários rápidos) [should have something?] and message text should be more visible (bigger). The sentence is truncated: "Nas guildas: os comentários rápidos e deixe os textos das mensagens com visibilidade melhor (maiores);". Perhaps they mean improve the quick replies too (maybe they're too small/cramped) and make the message text larger. Likely the guild chat quick replies ("Rápido:") and message bubbles need larger text.

Let me inspect the code.

Start with grep for ae-card-head and the volume detail gradient.","open":false,"collapse":"preview"}
